{"game": "the-first-descendant", "language": "english", "appid": 2074920, "month": "2025-09", "window": 3, "start_date": 1757980800, "end_date": 1758585599, "month_true_total": 299, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-01 15:48:26 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "204939312", "author": {"steamid": "76561198031188498", "personaname": "l0rdnuker", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198031188498/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 23741, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 22503, "last_played": 1761729948, "avatar": "fef49e7fa7e1997310d705b2a6158ff8dc1cdfeb"}, "language": "english", "review": "Used to be good at launch but the focus recently has shifted from content to cosmetics. Game.is very shallow and there's nothing much to do apart from grinding for builds. Event the Abyss fights now give vouchers for cosmetics. Story for expansions are getting shallow.\n\nWhat used to be a promising 3PS is jsut a husk for g00ner content now. This is quite visible when you go in social areas or group missions. You can clearly see how they are getting players to splash money on \"dress my doll\" game...\n\nThe game is also not optimised for new hardware. 4090 and later cards run on max 90%+ on ultra settings with frame generation on. Most of open world maps look similar to UE5 coding tutorials so you can guess.\n\nDevelopers are more interested in implementing jiggle physics rather than fixing the bugs or optimising the game (their focus is clearly on selling skins rather than the game).\n\nEvery season starts with major crash or bug release on PC. Console are relatively more stable. The gfx are good but not much content to make best use of it (unless you count skin as content).\n\nThis game is going downhill and even though it hasn't hit the rock bottom yet but it will be there in a few years. Unless the developers decide to create actual content rather then sell skins to g00ners, this is a pointless game.", "timestamp_created": 1758538714, "timestamp_updated": 1759410220, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 6, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.566549897193908691", "comment_count": 3, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1719730800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "204929359", "author": {"steamid": "76561197979207136", "personaname": "Chomusuke", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/chomusukethechosen/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 7, "playtime_forever": 194, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 194, "last_played": 1720815541, "avatar": "33d5e7cb29bcdc32834f7f54890d483538a23ecf"}, "language": "english", "review": "Game physics is pretty good considering it's from Nexon.", "timestamp_created": 1758522334, "timestamp_updated": 1758522334, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.467114090919494629", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1719730800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "204928156", "author": {"steamid": "76561199223044911", "personaname": "Larry", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199223044911/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 23, "playtime_forever": 587, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 288, "last_played": 1758708451, "avatar": "a79935f56da2c9706df2938d752689dccd7cc15f"}, "language": "english", "review": "Titikman", "timestamp_created": 1758520204, "timestamp_updated": 1758520204, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.467114090919494629", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "